        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average technology\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset encompasses the direct electricity consumption of the machine as well as compressed air and lubricant oil. Furthermore, the metal removed is included. Machine as well as factory infrastructure and operation are considered as well. The disposal of the lubricant oil is also included while the metal removed is assumed to be recycled. Degreasing is not included and has to be added if necessary.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
